parameters.jsonBody:
={{ {
  model: 'gpt-4o',
  messages: [
    {
      role: 'user',
      content: `You are an expert Marketing Strategist and Content Ideation AI.
Campaign Context: ${$json.body.campaignContext ? JSON.stringify($json.body.campaignContext) : 'None'}
User Request: ${$json.body.prompt}

Generate detailed content ideas based on the user request and campaign context.
IMPORTANT: YOU MUST RESPOND IN VIETNAMESE (TIẾNG VIỆT) OR THE SAME LANGUAGE AS THE USER REQUEST.
Respond in STRICT JSON format like this:
{
  "ideas": [
    {
      "title": "Idea Title (in Vietnamese)",
      "brief": "Detailed description of the idea (in Vietnamese)..."
    }
  ]
}`
    }
  ],
  response_format: { type: 'json_object' },
  tenant_id: $json.body.tenant_id
} }}

parameters.jsCode:
try {
  const aiResult = JSON.parse($input.item.json.choices[0].message.content);
  return { json: { ideas: aiResult.ideas || [], status: 'success' } };
} catch (e) {
  return { json: { ideas: [], status: 'error', reason: e.message } };
}
